{"sha": "2e25ca1aae58a4ca05117bec89b308a298c3c2f48b198cd3da681cc03f644115", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:charged-particles} 章 --- 电场与磁场中的带电粒子}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:1}", "$\\qty{1}{eV} = \\qty{1.60e-19}{J}$, $\\qty{13.6}{eV} = \\qty{2.18e-18}{J}$,", "$\\qty{1}{MeV} = \\qty{1.60e-13}{J}$。$v = \\sqrt{2eU/m}$：电子", "\\qty{1.9e7}{m/s}；质子 \\qty{4.4e5}{m/s}（慢 $\\sqrt{1836}$ 倍）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:2}", "$v = \\qty{1.88e7}{m/s}$; $R = mv/eB = 9.11\\times10^{-31} \\times 1.88\\times10^7/", "(1.6\\times10^{-19} \\times 10^{-3}) = \\qty{0.11}{m}$; $\\omega_c = eB/m =", "\\qty{1.8e8}{rad/s}$; $T = 2\\pi/\\omega_c = \\qty{36}{ns}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:3}", "$R = mv/qB = 1.67\\times10^{-27} \\times 10^5/(1.6\\times10^{-19} \\times 5\\times", "10^{-5}) = \\qty{21}{m}$。在 $30^\\circ$ 时，半径为 $R\\sin 30^\\circ", "= \\qty{10}{m}$ 的螺旋线，螺距为 $2\\pi(m/qB)v\\cos 30^\\circ = \\qty{114}{m}$，", "沿磁场线漂移。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:4}", "$v = E/B = 10^4/0.020 = \\qty{5.0e5}{m/s}$。速率较大的离子：磁力", "占优，向磁力一侧偏转；电荷相反而", "速率相同的粒子：两力同时反向，仍然平衡——选择器", "对电荷符号和质量都不敏感。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:5}", "$\\tan\\alpha = EL/2U_0 = 10^4 \\times 0.04/4000 = 0.10$；偏移量", "$0.30 \\times 0.10 = \\qty{3.0}{cm}$；灵敏度 \\qty{0.30}{mm/V}。较快的", "电子在极板间停留时间较短：$\\tan\\alpha \\propto 1/U_0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:6}", "$R = \\sqrt{2mU/e}/B$: $m_{12} = \\qty{1.99e-26}{kg}$, $R_{12} = \\sqrt{2 \\times", "1.99\\times10^{-26} \\times 2\\times10^4/1.6\\times10^{-19}}/0.5 = \\qty{14.1}{cm}$;", "$R_{13} = R_{12}\\sqrt{13/12} = \\qty{14.7}{cm}$；落点间距 $2\\Delta R =", "\\qty{1.2}{cm}$（两落点的半径相差 \\qty{5.8}{mm}，", "直径相差其两倍）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:7}", "$f_c = eB/2\\pi m = \\qty{23}{MHz}$; $E_k = e^2B^2R^2/2m = \\qty{4.3e-12}{J} =", "\\qty{27}{MeV}$；每圈 \\qty{100}{keV}：$270$ 圈；时间 $270/f_c =", "\\qty{12}{\\micro s}$; $\\gamma - 1 = 27/938 = 2.9\\%$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:8}", "$v_\\perp = \\qty{5.0e5}{m/s}$, $v_\\parallel = \\qty{8.7e5}{m/s}$: $R = mv_\\perp/eB", "= 9.11\\times10^{-31} \\times 5\\times10^5/(3.2\\times10^{-22}) = \\qty{1.4}{mm}$;", "周期 $2\\pi m/eB = \\qty{18}{ns}$，螺距 $v_\\parallel T = \\qty{1.5}{cm}$：", "每米约 $64$ 圈。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:9}", "$U_H = IB/nqd = 5.0/(8.5\\times10^{28} \\times 1.6\\times10^{-19} \\times 10^{-3})", "= \\qty{3.7e-7}{V}$：亚微伏量级。若 $n$ 小千万倍，", "则半导体可得毫伏量级电压——一种实用的传感器。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:10}", "$m\\,\\dd\\vect v/\\dd t = q\\vect v\\wedge\\vect B$；与 $\\vect v$ 点乘：$\\dd(\\tfrac12 mv^2)/", "\\dd t = 0$，无论 $\\vect B(\\vect r, t)$ 如何，只要没有 $\\vect E$。", "速度的方向、曲率半径、螺距都可能", "改变；速率和动能（\\qty{10}{keV}）则不能。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:11}", "$m\\dot v_x = qv_yB$，$m\\dot v_y = qE - qv_xB$，$v_z = 0$。取 $\\vect v =", "(E/B)\\vect e_x + \\vect w$：$m\\dot w_x = qw_yB$，$m\\dot w_y = -qw_xB$ ——", "即 $\\vect w$ 以 $\\omega_c$ 做纯粹的回旋运动。从静止出发，", "$\\vect w(0) = -(E/B)\\vect e_x$：$\\vect w$ 的模恒为 $E/B$，于是", "速度等于漂移速度 $E/B$ 与一个模相同的旋转矢量之和——", "摆线，在 $\\vect v = \\vect 0$ 处出现尖点。电子：漂移速度 $E/B =", "\\qty{1.0e5}{m/s}$，$\\omega_c = \\qty{1.8e10}{rad/s}$，拱高 $2mE/qB^2 =", "\\qty{11}{\\micro m}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:charged-particles:12}", "$R = mv_0/eB = 9.11\\times10^{-31} \\times 2.65\\times10^7/(1.6\\times10^{-22}) =", "\\qty{0.15}{m}$；$\\alpha \\approx L/R = 0.04/0.15 = 0.27$（约 $15^\\circ$）：", "偏移量 $\\approx 0.30 \\times 0.27 = \\qty{8}{cm}$，所需磁场仅为适中的", "毫特斯拉量级。若要用极板获得大偏转角，则需千伏电压和较长的", "极板；而线圈可使束流偏转数十度，", "且完全不需要电压。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:charged-particles:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\vect F = e\\vect v\\wedge\\vect B \\perp \\vect v$：不做功，速率", "恒定。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $mv^2/R = evB$：$R = mv/eB$；$T = 2\\pi R/v = 2\\pi m/eB$，与", "$v$ 无关。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $f_c = eB/2\\pi m = 1.6\\times10^{-19} \\times 1.5/(2\\pi \\times 1.67", "\\times10^{-27}) = \\qty{23}{MHz}$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} $eU = \\qty{50}{keV}$ 每次穿越间隙，\\qty{100}{keV} 每圈。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 每次质子到达时，间隙都必须处于加速极性，", "两次到达相隔半个周期；频率偏离时，相位会滑移，", "最终的加速冲量会使粒子减速。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 绕行一圈后 $E_k = \\qty{100}{keV}$，$v = \\sqrt{2E_k/m} =", "\\qty{4.4e6}{m/s}$，$R = mv/eB = \\qty{3.0}{cm}$；绕行 $n$ 圈后 $E_k =", "n \\times \\qty{100}{keV}$，$R = \\qty{3.0}{cm}\\sqrt n$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $E_k = e^2B^2R^2/2m = \\qty{4.3e-12}{J} = \\qty{27}{MeV}$; $v =", "\\sqrt{2E_k/m} = \\qty{7.2e7}{m/s} = 0.24c$.", ""]}